e weighted average number of shares outstanding between the redeemable and non-redeemable shares. Any remeasurement of the accretion to redemption value of the ordinary shares subject to possible redemption was considered to be dividends paid to the public shareholders."}],"wc":[{"heading":null,"text":"In order to fund working capital deficiencies or finance transaction costs in connection with an intended initial business combination, our Sponsor or an affiliate of our Sponsor or certain of our officers and directors may, but are not obligated to, loan us funds on a non-interest bearing basis as may be required. If we complete our initial business combination, we would repay such loaned amounts. In the event that our initial business combination does not close, we may use a portion of the working capital held outside the trust account to repay such loaned amounts but no proceeds from our trust account would be used for such repayment. Other than as described above, the terms of such loans by our officers and directors, if any, have not been determined and no written agreements exist with respect to such loans."}]},"capex_src":null,"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Excluding Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"cor":{"c":"us-gaap:CostOfRevenue","l":"Cost of Revenue","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"gp":{"c":"us-gaap:GrossProfit","l":"Gross Profit","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"rd":{"c":"us-gaap:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpense","l":"Research and Development Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"sm":{"c":"us-gaap:SellingAndMarketingExpense","l":"Selling and Marketing Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ga":{"c":"us-gaap:GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense","l":"General and Administrative Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"opex_total":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingExpenses","l":"Operating Expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"oi":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss","l":"Operating Income (Loss)","ytd